final(c,'Why was the initial history incomplete?','Mengapa riwayat awal tidak lengkap?', [('Mara identified the drug by sight','Mara mengenali obat dari tampilannya'),('A normal examination excluded medication effects','Pemeriksaan normal menyingkirkan efek obat'),('The product was prescribed by Leila','Produk diresepkan oleh Leila'),('The form omitted supplements and Daniel concealed one','Formulir tidak mencakup suplemen dan Daniel menyembunyikannya')],3,'An omission is explained without assuming every patient statement is false.','Kelalaian dapat dijelaskan tanpa menganggap semua keterangan pasien salah.')
c=case(2,'The Perfect Alibi','Alibi yang Sempurna','Observation & psychology','Observasi & psikologi','Blackthorn House','Blackthorn House','At a private dinner, a rare pocket watch vanishes from a locked display. Five guests have convincing stories. One describes something nobody in the dining room could have seen.','Saat jamuan pribadi, jam saku langka lenyap dari etalase terkunci. Lima tamu punya cerita yang meyakinkan. Salah satunya menjelaskan sesuatu yang mustahil dilihat dari ruang makan.','Dining room|Display gallery|Security office|Guest interviews|Reconstruction','Ruang makan|Galeri koleksi|Ruang keamanan|Wawancara tamu|Rekonstruksi',[
('Celia Voss','Art dealer','Pedagang seni',41,'I stayed by the dining-room window until the bell. The blue lining was empty when the case opened.','Saya di dekat jendela ruang makan sampai bel berbunyi. Lapisan biru itu kosong saat etalase dibuka.','I inspected the display last year, before the lining was changed from red.','Saya memeriksa etalase tahun lalu, sebelum lapisannya diganti dari merah.'),('Edmund Vale','Host','Tuan rumah',58,'Only I and the conservator have keys.','Hanya saya dan konservator yang punya kunci.','The new blue liner was installed privately this afternoon.','Lapisan biru baru dipasang secara tertutup sore ini.'),('Iris Shaw','Conservator','Konservator',36,'I left at 19:40 and returned when the alarm sounded.','Saya pergi pukul 19.40 dan kembali saat alarm berbunyi.','My spare key was in a numbered envelope in the gallery drawer.','Kunci cadangan saya berada dalam amplop bernomor di laci galeri.'),('Theo March','Pianist','Pianis',29,'I played through the corridor blackout.','Saya terus bermain saat lampu koridor padam.','A person crossed toward the gallery; I could not see a face.','Seseorang melintas menuju galeri; saya tidak bisa melihat wajahnya.'),('Nadia Reed','Journalist','Jurnalis',33,'I was interviewing the host near the piano.','Saya mewawancarai tuan rumah di dekat piano.','My recorder captured the bell at 20:12 and our uninterrupted conversation.','Perekam saya menangkap bel pukul 20.12 dan percakapan kami tanpa jeda.')],
'Celia used the conservator’s spare key during the 20:08–20:11 corridor blackout. The dining camera showed only her chair and a coat, not her body. Her spontaneous reference to the new blue liner at 20:13 preceded the public opening at 20:16; her prior visit explains knowledge of the old red liner only. Entry records, a uniquely numbered torn key envelope in her bag, and the watch recovered from its stitched pouch corroborate opportunity and possession. Her consignment debt supplies a motive, not proof. The remaining guests’ accounts have independent corroboration. Nervousness and facial expressions play no evidentiary role.',
'Celia memakai kunci cadangan konservator saat koridor padam pukul 20.08–20.11. Kamera ruang makan hanya merekam kursi dan mantel, bukan tubuhnya. Ucapannya tentang lapisan biru baru pada 20.13 mendahului pembukaan etalase di depan tamu pada 20.16; kunjungan lamanya hanya menjelaskan pengetahuan tentang lapisan merah. Catatan masuk, sobekan amplop kunci bernomor unik di tasnya, dan jam yang ditemukan dalam kantong berjahit menguatkan kesempatan serta penguasaan barang. Utang konsinyasi memberi motif, bukan bukti. Keterangan tamu lain memiliki penguat independen. Kegugupan serta ekspresi wajah tidak dipakai sebagai bukti.')
w=[('All five guests were continuously visible.','Kelima tamu terus terlihat.'),('The host’s debt proves theft.','Utang tuan rumah membuktikan pencurian.'),('A nervous expression identifies the thief.','Ekspresi gugup mengidentifikasi pencuri.')]
rows=[
('Seating plan','Denah tempat duduk','Celia’s chair is behind a tall floral arrangement. The camera cannot see her seated torso.','Kursi Celia berada di balik rangkaian bunga tinggi. Kamera tidak dapat melihat tubuhnya saat duduk.','An occupied-looking chair is not a continuous visual alibi.','Kursi yang tampak terisi bukan alibi visual berkelanjutan.'),
('Camera audit','Audit kamera','20:07–20:12: a coat remains on Celia’s chair. No face or hands are visible. The feed is authentic.','20.07–20.12: mantel tetap berada di kursi Celia. Wajah atau tangan tidak terlihat. Rekamannya asli.','Authentic footage can still leave a blind spot.','Rekaman asli tetap dapat memiliki titik buta.'),
('Maintenance log','Catatan pemeliharaan','A scheduled circuit test darkens the gallery corridor from 20:08 to 20:11. The dining room remains lit.','Uji sirkuit terjadwal memadamkan koridor galeri dari 20.08 hingga 20.11. Ruang makan tetap terang.','There is a bounded opportunity window.','Ada rentang kesempatan yang jelas.'),
('Display invoice','Faktur etalase','At 16:00 today, Iris replaced the faded red liner with blue velvet behind closed doors. No public photographs were taken.','Pukul 16.00 hari ini, Iris mengganti lapisan merah pudar dengan beludru biru secara tertutup. Tidak ada foto publik.','Old familiarity cannot explain knowledge of the blue liner.','Pengetahuan lama tidak menjelaskan pengetahuan tentang lapisan biru.'),
('First response transcript','Transkrip respons pertama','20:13, Celia: “The blue lining was empty.” The opaque case was opened publicly at 20:16.','20.13, Celia: “Lapisan biru itu kosong.” Etalase buram baru dibuka di depan umum pada 20.16.','Celia describes a concealed detail before the public reveal.','Celia menjelaskan detail tersembunyi sebelum diperlihatkan kepada umum.'),
('Key register','Daftar kunci','Spare key envelope K-17 was intact at 19:55. At 20:17 it is torn open and the key has been returned.','Amplop kunci cadangan K-17 utuh pukul 19.55. Pukul 20.17 amplop robek terbuka dan kunci telah dikembalikan.','The spare key was accessed during the relevant interval.','Kunci cadangan diakses dalam rentang waktu yang relevan.'),
('Recorder timeline','Linimasa perekam','Nadia and Edmund speak continuously from 20:06 to 20:14. Theo’s piano is audible throughout. Iris appears on the gate camera at 20:10.','Nadia dan Edmund berbicara terus dari 20.06 sampai 20.14. Piano Theo terdengar sepanjang rekaman. Iris terlihat di kamera gerbang pukul 20.10.','Other accounts have independent timing support.','Keterangan lain memiliki penguat waktu independen.'),
('Bag inventory','Inventaris tas','With consent, security finds a torn corner stamped K-17 in Celia’s bag. Its irregular edge fits the key envelope.','Dengan izin, petugas menemukan sudut sobekan berstempel K-17 di tas Celia. Tepi tak beraturannya cocok dengan amplop kunci.','Physical evidence links Celia to the opened key envelope.','Bukti fisik menghubungkan Celia dengan amplop kunci yang dibuka.'),
('Recovered object','Barang yang ditemukan','The missing watch, serial V-809, is recovered from a stitched pouch inside Celia’s coat after a lawful search.','Jam hilang bernomor V-809 ditemukan dalam kantong berjahit di mantel Celia melalui penggeledahan sah.','Possession independently corroborates the reconstructed opportunity.','Penguasaan barang menguatkan rekonstruksi kesempatan secara independen.'),
('Consignment correspondence','Korespondensi konsinyasi','Celia owes a buyer a matching watch. Edmund also has debts, but has no verified connection to the key envelope or pouch.','Celia berutang jam sejenis kepada pembeli. Edmund juga punya utang, tetapi tidak terhubung secara terverifikasi dengan amplop atau kantong.','A shared motive does not outweigh discriminating evidence.','Motif yang sama tidak mengalahkan bukti pembeda.')]
for r in rows:ev(c,*r,w)
